- Nemlig.

28:48.309 --> 28:50.019
Fucking kællinger.

28:54.941 --> 28:57.861
Giv mig to kartoner Marlboro Red.

29:01.990 --> 29:04.159
Sænk venligst masken, og vis ID.

29:06.911 --> 29:08.371
Hallo, dame.

29:10.123 --> 29:11.624
